                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "A tap pad beside the number pad; the row only says 'tap or type' because both work. Tap goes straight to the engine and the field then MIRRORS what the engine made of it \u2014 a tapped tempo is runtime state with nothing to submit. The first keypress replaces the shown tempo rather than appending. Backspace is an icon, not '\u232b': the text face has no U+232B and a tofu box is a worse mark than none."
              }
